      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofharlan.com/vnews/display.v/SEC/General%7CAbout%20Us",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every evening, the downtown area lights up with nightly rooftop shows, while outdoor music keeps the streets lively.",
